<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
    <title>Welcome to CraftBridge</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 520px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border-top: 4px solid #15803d; }
      h2 { color: #111; margin-top: 0; }
      p { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #4b5563; }
      .features-list { margin: 20px 0; padding-left: 20px; }
      .features-list li { font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #374151; }
      .cta-box { background: #f0fdf4; border: 1px dashed #bbf7d0; padding: 15px; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 20px; text-align: center; }
      .footer { margin-top: 35px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; font-size: 12px; color: #888; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Welcome to CraftBridge, <%= name %>!</h2>
      <p>Thanks for joining CraftBridge System. Your account has been created successfully as a <strong><%= role.toLowerCase() %></strong>.</p>
      
      <!-- 🎯 Client Specific Feature Blocks -->
      <% if (role.toUpperCase() === 'CLIENT') { %>
        <p>Get ready to bring your ideas to life! As a Client, you have full access to our global ecosystem of elite creators. Here is what you can do right now:</p>
        <ul class="features-list">
          <li><strong>Post Projects:</strong> Outline your requirements and receive competitive project proposals.</li>
          <li><strong>Hire Elite Talent:</strong> Browse creator portfolios, compare rates, and start milestone contracts.</li>
          <li><strong>Secure Payments:</strong> Pay safely using our integrated automated escrow infrastructure.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta-box">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #166534;">🚀 Ready to build? Explore creator services or publish your first project request on your dashboard.</p>
        </div>

      <!-- 🎯 Creator Specific Feature Blocks -->
      <% } else if (role.toUpperCase() === 'CREATOR') { %>
        <p>Welcome to the ultimate hub for professional matching and workflow execution! As a Creator, your workspace tools are unlocked and live:</p>
        <ul class="features-list">
          <li><strong>Build Your Portfolio:</strong> Showcase your past deliverables, skills, and set up your hourly rates.</li>
          <li><strong>Submit Proposals:</strong> Apply directly to active client projects matching your industry expertise.</li>
          <li><strong>Manage Contracts:</strong> Deliver milestones, manage item revisions, and track pending payments easily.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta-box">
          <p style="margin: 0; font-weight: bold; color: #166534;">💼 Complete your profile setting fields (skills, experience, and bio) to stay visible in search recommendations!</p>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="footer">&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> CraftBridge System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
